	(text "R707 (DNP) is not needed for protection. It is a bench load in place of the LED string: 330R with R708 = 10R gives 6.9 V, 0.14 W. Do not fit 1.8k-13k: FB stays above 30 mV and the open-LED protection no longer trips."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 238.76 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
