	(text "R706: CTRL low = backlight off while PB5 floats in reset (the chip also has 300k inside). CTRL low for 2.5 ms = shutdown. PWM 5-100 kHz; LED current = duty x 204 mV / R708 (analog dimming)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 223.52 0)
