	(text "No panel or open string: LED_A rises to the OVP threshold (36-39 V), then U701 latches off until CTRL goes low and high again. C705 is 50 V, D701 40 V. Without a panel LED_A sits at +5V minus the diode drop."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
