	(text "Innolux AT043TN24: pins 37-40 are the resistive touch film (X1, Y1, X2, Y2): remove R701-R704, or the film ties TP_RST to I2C4_SCL and TP_INT to I2C4_SDA. Its pins 32, 33 are NC (DE mode only)."
